      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "One method can have many callers. Here three things call Door.Open: a Signal on a Timeline, through the Signal Receiver on the door; a button on the screen; and the component's right-click menu, added by the line [ContextMenu(\"Open\")]. In Play mode, the menu is a quick test before anything else is connected.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Open is called in three ways. Does each way run a different method of Door?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play and click 2 \xB7 Play the Timeline: its Signal opens Door 2.\n2. Right-click the Door component \u203A Close, then click 2 \xB7 Open the door.\n3. Close it again, then right-click the Door component \u203A Open."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
