  m_text: "<b>Exercise \xB7 Predict</b>\n\n<b>Task:</b>\n1. Before pressing Play, read PredictSignal.cs. The Timeline beside this stand sends its Signal twice, and the Signal calls StepUp.\n2. Write down how many times each line will run.\n3. Press Play, select Block E1, and wait 5 seconds. In Code Watch, check the count beside each method."
