  m_text: "<b>Exercise \xB7 Write</b>\n\n<b>Task:</b>\n1. Read ToggleAction.cs (Packages \u203A Toolbox \u203A Runtime \u203A Actions), then the three actions beside this stand.\n2. Copy ActionTemplate.cs as DayNightAction.cs and rename the class to match. Write SetNight() and SetDay(), which change a Light's intensity.\n3. Add it to Your Action, drag the Sun into its Light slot, and test it in Play mode with the right-click menu."
