  m_text: 'An event field, such as a reaction of a Signal Receiver or a button''s On Click, offers a list of methods to call. Unity builds the list from the script: a public method can be in it, a private method never is. The list also holds public methods every script inherits from MonoBehaviour.


    <b>Predict:</b> Door.cs declares Start, Open and Close. Which of them are in the list?


    <b>Try:</b>

    1. Select Door 3. In its Signal Receiver, click the box that shows Door.Open.

    2. Point at Door in the list and read its methods.

    3. In Door.cs, read the word in front of each method: public or private.'
