      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A call chosen in an event's list can hand over nothing, or one value typed in the Inspector: a float, an int, a bool, a string, or a reference to an object. It cannot hand over a Color. So FlashAction keeps its color in a variable, targetColor, and Flash() asks for nothing.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> FlashAction has Flash() and FlashWith(Color color). Which of the two does the On Click list of 5 \xB7 Flash offer?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play and click 5 \xB7 Flash.\n2. Select the button 5 \xB7 Flash in the Canvas. In On Click, open the list \u203A FlashAction.\n3. On Sphere 5, change Target Color, and click the button again."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
